      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "计算机网络的“始祖”：阿帕网 (ARPANET)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "计算机网络的“始祖”：阿帕网 (ARPANET)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_xXaqGldtiPuLqP_6v_nM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1117.60009765625,
      "y": -496.29994201660156,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1255106198,
      "version": 220,
      "versionNonce": 1984976278,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "现代互联网并非起源于商业，而是源于军事需求。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "现代互联网并非起源于商业，而是源于军事需求。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5wo8SzstnABhcwlGyluiq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110.5301208496094,
      "y": -457.3000030517578,
      "width": 545.3399047851562,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 422606282,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 364508874,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 定义：阿帕网 (ARPANET) 被公认为现代互联网的“始祖”。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 定义：阿帕网 (ARPANET) 被公认为现代互联网的“始祖”。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hFkUJJKTTWi5kirQ0bJ_3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1110.5501708984375,
      "y": -420.6999969482422,
      "width": 610.89990234375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 680666070,
      "version": 125,
      "versionNonce": 874328790,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 背景：由美国国防部高级研究计划局（ARPA/DARPA）资助建立。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 背景：由美国国防部高级研究计划局（ARPA/DARPA）资助建立。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iIevePUDRL4sJ3UKXTNAC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1113.2901611328125,
      "y": -382.99998474121094,
      "width": 832.6197509765626,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2079534218,
      "version": 258,
      "versionNonce": 228887946,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 技术突破：它是世界上第一个投入运行的分组交换网络（Packet Switching Network）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 技术突破：它是世界上第一个投入运行的分组交换网络（Packet Switching Network）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x2GFZfjYVg820E-xNvfFo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1114.379981994629,
      "y": -343.2999725341797,
      "width": 118.43998718261719,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1368078614,
      "version": 200,
      "versionNonce": 1994156054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 关键节点：",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 关键节点：",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DLgZSru6nN5UzE85P04c5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1169.9800720214844,
      "y": -309.09999084472656,
      "width": 285.63995361328125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1253116746,
      "version": 124,
      "versionNonce": 1099844682,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 1960年代：诞生与初步建立。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 1960年代：诞生与初步建立。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "N6WhZfNxRyNGKsU80y52v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1169.3201293945312,
      "y": -273.3000030517578,
      "width": 483.7598876953125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1026532950,
      "version": 131,
      "versionNonce": 511898966,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776684178583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 1970年代：TCP/IP协议开始萌芽，节点数量扩展。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 1970年代：TCP/IP协议开始萌芽，节点数量扩展。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
