      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776730583298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "中国互联网的崛起（1994年及以后）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "中国互联网的崛起（1994年及以后）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0tXugSOlxOX6AWeuEkgoh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 14.21002197265625,
      "y": -139.89996337890625,
      "width": 389.1799011230469,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brM",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1502053322,
      "version": 612,
      "versionNonce": 1122348102,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776730583298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1994年：中国正式接入公网（Internet）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1994年：中国正式接入公网（Internet）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UU4Vp6JXx7jhAPb1YgiXs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10.399978637695312,
      "y": -93.5999755859375,
      "width": 865.5999755859376,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 125498838,
      "version": 780,
      "versionNonce": 724841350,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776730583298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "行业拓荒者：那个时代诞生了网易（丁磊）、搜狐（张朝阳）、腾讯（马化腾）、百度（李彦宏）\n和阿里巴巴（马云）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "行业拓荒者：那个时代诞生了网易（丁磊）、搜狐（张朝阳）、腾讯（马化腾）、百度（李彦宏）和阿里巴巴（马云）。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "IxFJSKurVBJXgVwv4ctEY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7.0799713134765625,
      "y": -24.999969482421875,
      "width": 782.6399536132812,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2050521738,
      "version": 604,
      "versionNonce": 1857016518,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776730583298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "关键转折点：2003年非典（SARS）期间，大众开始习惯网购，这客观上“救活”并壮大了\n当时的淘宝。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "关键转折点：2003年非典（SARS）期间，大众开始习惯网购，这客观上“救活”并壮大了当时的淘宝。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
