      "seed": 560965654,
      "version": 136,
      "versionNonce": 443921162,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776686186804,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- 物理上，说话并没有直接给对方听，而是给了手机、电话，通过网络协议传给对方听。只\n不过这个过程太快了，让你以为是在跟C直接通信",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- 物理上，说话并没有直接给对方听，而是给了手机、电话，通过网络协议传给对方听。只不过这个过程太快了，让你以为是在跟C直接通信",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pjwOmLlrsX3HBh18WHTyV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1405.4901123046875,
      "y": 4046.7667032877603,
      "width": 456.219970703125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
