      "seed": 1559939222,
      "version": 348,
      "versionNonce": 2003330518,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776689937919,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "具体规定七层，实现了五层。我们不谈硬件，就讲四层协议，只说软件层。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "具体规定七层，实现了五层。我们不谈硬件，就讲四层协议，只说软件层。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Jjhg34BOfFqq6I3PZVMQD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1547.3198547363281,
      "y": 4143.966608683268,
      "width": 289.36004638671886,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 459551690,
      "version": 874,
      "versionNonce": 1487617482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776690410475,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP/IP是一种网络协议，由\nTCP和IP两个协议组成。\n它负责在计算机网络中传输数\n据，并确保数据传输的可靠性，\n同时确定数据在网络中的路径。\nTCP/IP是网络通信的基础，\n也是网络上最常用的协议之一。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP/IP是一种网络协议，由TCP和IP两个协议组成。\n它负责在计算机网络中传输数据，并确保数据传输的可靠性，\n同时确定数据在网络中的路径。TCP/IP是网络通信的基础，\n也是网络上最常用的协议之一。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
