    {
      "id": "y4_uK0oJ5mJEgMeE3PfBC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 846.0000305175781,
      "y": 7598.655500623914,
      "width": 256.79998779296875,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1537896266,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 822087050,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776690892105,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "协议的本质：一种“解决方案”",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "协议的本质：一种“解决方案”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hUuItXdgybjtTkPS0kzzz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 849.60009765625,
      "y": 7633.655500623914,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1575912022,
      "version": 132,
      "versionNonce": 1761142806,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776690892105,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "针对上述距离变长产生的问题，人类设计了协议。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "针对上述距离变长产生的问题，人类设计了协议。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DABRyBxx_23zCgmcfjLEk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 849.6001586914062,
      "y": 7667.055525037977,
      "width": 516.7999267578125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 535950858,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 1836698698,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776690892105,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 定义：协议就是针对上述问题的解决方案（Solution）。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 定义：协议就是针对上述问题的解决方案（Solution）。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pWyQEnnAAYps3--r6yR7L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 851.1801452636719,
      "y": 7700.255537245008,
      "width": 798.4400024414062,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 148359062,
      "version": 238,
      "versionNonce": 420443478,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776690892105,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 生活类比：就像异地恋。同在一所大学时，见面（通信）很简单；但当跨城工作后，距离\n变长了，就需要约定“每天晚上 8 点打视频”、“谁先挂电话”等协议来维护关系。人没变，\n但解决距离问题的方法（协议）变复杂了。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 生活类比：就像异地恋。同在一所大学时，见面（通信）很简单；但当跨城工作后，距离变长了，就需要约定“每天晚上 8 点打视频”、“谁先挂电话”等协议来维护关系。人没变，但解决距离问题的方法（协议）变复杂了。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
