    {
      "id": "MoaF95avdmRCvKferyN3K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1461.60009765625,
      "y": 7840.699966430664,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1811423882,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 1294459798,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776690992523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "为什么存在这么多问题，不都是距离变长了导致的嘛！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "为什么存在这么多问题，不都是距离变长了导致的嘛！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0bCoxXmlzIYrl0Ndgrc32",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1466.0001220703125,
      "y": 7878.0999755859375,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 150512406,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 806903254,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776690995724,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "我们为了解决这些问题就有了协议",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "我们为了解决这些问题就有了协议",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gnMIsqKUkkCDiG0UaZAbd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1468.8001708984375,
      "y": 7916.0999755859375,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 447168842,
      "version": 324,
      "versionNonce": 831641290,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776691003114,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "协议本质是一种解决方案！",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "协议本质是一种解决方案！",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "8Nx8A4O-PAbPPd6FqkzGu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1459.2000732421875,
      "y": 7991.399993896484,
      "width": 542.4000244140625,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 929026134,
      "version": 353,
      "versionNonce": 397111894,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776691019526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "因为问题是不同种类不同性质的，所以要有不同的解决方案。\n所以协议这种就要被设置成分层的，因为问题是分层的。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "因为问题是不同种类不同性质的，所以要有不同的解决方案。\n所以协议这种就要被设置成分层的，因为问题是分层的。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iU94b54ErfxD5iF7lQG6R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1451.2001953125,
      "y": 8055.0999755859375,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1266976778,
      "version": 118,
      "versionNonce": 538530890,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776691030150,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "问题是层状的，解决方案也必然是层状的，所以协议一定是分层的。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "问题是层状的，解决方案也必然是层状的，所以协议一定是分层的。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rtK59yKRym_tqWGsgfVrG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1455.4801025390625,
      "y": 8093.299957275391,
      "width": 589.8399658203125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 49239446,
      "version": 192,
      "versionNonce": 305434762,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776691042662,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OSI设计的时候也是这样想的，认为问题有7种，提出了这套标准。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OSI设计的时候也是这样想的，认为问题有7种，提出了这套标准。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NlVcm7HrCQnddUjorefYs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1451.0222507052954,
      "y": 8137.311119927298,
      "width": 729.7778320312505,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1720383178,
      "version": 378,
      "versionNonce": 938849478,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776732343164,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "但是大家在真正实现的时候，发现应用层，表示层，会话层是没办法独立设计的\n就整合了起来为应用层。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "但是大家在真正实现的时候，发现应用层，表示层，会话层是没办法独立设计的\n就整合了起来为应用层。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
