      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776691120344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "永远记住",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "永远记住",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lEpR2nNSJPkNCqStqD_qF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 725.3201293945312,
      "y": 8287.499969482422,
      "width": 784.5599365234375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 748391766,
      "version": 172,
      "versionNonce": 457505162,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776691120344,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP/IP 协议簇的本质就是一套解决“远距离通信”的组合方案。学习每一层时，都要问自\n己一个问题：这一层是为了解决“距离”带来的哪一个具体麻烦？这样你的逻辑就会非常清\n晰。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP/IP 协议簇的本质就是一套解决“远距离通信”的组合方案。学习每一层时，都要问自己一个问题：这一层是为了解决“距离”带来的哪一个具体麻烦？这样你的逻辑就会非常清晰。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "51PpktdK8d9hB5QgEVPZp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5.720062255859375,
      "y": 8409.500030517578,
      "width": 617.9310482226311,
      "height": 32.20001220703125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bsq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1201736918,
      "version": 128,
      "versionNonce": 535336086,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776691149656,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TCP/IP协议与操作系统的关系（宏观上，怎么实现）",
      "fontSize": 25.760009765625004,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TCP/IP协议与操作系统的关系（宏观上，怎么实现）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
