      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776692524407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "【总结启发】",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "【总结启发】",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XYIPOGJQNB-D1TRD08_dN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1401.1980895996094,
      "y": 10147.57782321506,
      "width": 618.7598876953125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1983652374,
      "version": 462,
      "versionNonce": 1789243018,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776692524407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "网络是 OS 的一部分：由于底层逻辑相同，你只需要学习一套 Socket\n编程接口，就可以在 Windows 和 Linux 下游刃有余。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "网络是 OS 的一部分：由于底层逻辑相同，你只需要学习一套 Socket 编程接口，就可以在 Windows 和 Linux 下游刃有余。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L-Y3mCrEshrb1duTt8jBl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1403.6180114746094,
      "y": 10209.277835422092,
      "width": 626.719970703125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 882848330,
      "version": 501,
      "versionNonce": 63130954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776692524407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "分层的力量：应用层管“业务”，内核层管“传输”，驱动层管“硬件”。这\n种结构保证了即便你换了一张不同品牌的网卡，你的 QQ 代码也一个字\n都不用改。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "分层的力量：应用层管“业务”，内核层管“传输”，驱动层管“硬件”。这种结构保证了即便你换了一张不同品牌的网卡，你的 QQ 代码也一个字都不用改。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f9isoRForDjqu6ZU1N3rK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1405.3779907226562,
      "y": 10296.677859836154,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1306226518,
      "version": 518,
      "versionNonce": 1295979530,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776692524407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "思考问题：为什么网络编程通常比普通编程难调试？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "思考问题：为什么网络编程通常比普通编程难调试？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BcoPPRZXG4aqidoiGWl-Y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1407.8980407714844,
      "y": 10335.977847629123,
      "width": 616.5599365234375,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "btD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 592861450,
      "version": 507,
      "versionNonce": 1762919114,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776692524407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "答案：因为大部分逻辑（TCP/IP）都跑在你看不到的“内核态”里，一\n旦出问题，往往需要借助 tcpdump 等工具去观测内核的行为。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "答案：因为大部分逻辑（TCP/IP）都跑在你看不到的“内核态”里，一旦出问题，往往需要借助 tcpdump 等工具去观测内核的行为。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
